{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/106-yi-jie/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/106-yi-jie/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 猗嗟 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 齊風 · 猗嗟 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《猗嗟》的 5 条注释，含 5 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"106-yi-jie","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/106-yi-jie/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"106-yi-jie","title":"猗嗟","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"qifeng","path":["風","齊風","猗嗟"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"猗嗟昌兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"頎而長兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"抑若揚兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"美目揚兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"巧趨蹌兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"射則臧兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"猗嗟名兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"美目清兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"儀既成兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"終日射侯","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"不出正兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"展我甥兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"猗嗟孌兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"清揚婉兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"舞則選兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"射則貫兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"四矢反兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"以禦亂兮","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":5,"glossCount":5},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"美魯莊公材藝之美也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 篇首题注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《猗嗟》三章，章六句。此齊人初見莊公，而歎其威儀技藝之美，不失名門子，而又可以爲戡亂材。誠哉，其爲齊侯之甥也！意本贊美。以其母不賢，故自後人觀之，而以爲刺耳。於是紛紛議論，並謂「展我甥兮」一句，以爲微詞。將詩人忠厚待人本意，盡情説壞。是皆後儒深文苛刻之論有以啟之也。愚於是詩不以爲刺，而以爲美。非好立異，原詩人作詩本意，蓋如是耳。至詩中言射，錯綜入妙，有目可以共賞，故不再煩辭費。","targetNotes":"总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"一章描摹莊公，如見其人。","targetNotes":"眉评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 眉评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"眉評"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"射古者諸侯相朝，則有賓射。故是詩所言，皆以賓射爲主。案：《春秋》莊四年冬，「公及齊人狩于禚」。此詩疑即狩禚事，蓋公朝齊而因以狩也。名猶稱也。侯正〔劉氏瑾曰〕《周禮·梓人》有皮侯、采侯、獸侯，天子大射用皮侯，賓射用采侯，燕射用獸侯。鵠以皮爲之，正則布爲之。《射義》注「畫布曰正，棲皮曰鵠」是也。展誠也。甥姊妹之子曰甥。選異於衆也。四矢〔鄭氏康成曰〕禮，射三而止。每射四矢，皆得其故處，此之謂復射。必四矢者，象其能禦四方之亂也。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集釋"}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"昌七陽。長、揚、蹌、臧並同。本韻。名八庚。清、成、正、甥並同。本韻。孌十七霰。婉十三阮，叶許願反。選十七霰。貫十五翰，叶扃縣反。反十三阮，叶孚絢反。亂十五翰，叶靈眷反。叶韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"標韻"}]}]}}}
